  "notes_for_reviewer": "Official uva.nl page read 2026-10-06: 2026-2027 institutional tuition fee for non-EEA bachelor students by faculty (EUR per year): Humanities 17,500; Economics and Business 13,900; Social and Behavioural Sciences 16,670; Law 17,500; Science 21,800; Amsterdam University College 20,430; Medicine and Dentistry 34,700 (not included). The statutory fee that EU students pay is EUR 2,694 (full-time); non-EEA students pay the institutional fee instead (the page does not say whether the statutory fee is added: please check). The cards are FACULTY-level: UvA has many individual programmes with their own pages that I did not collect, and not every programme is taught in English: language \"en\" is an assumption for the English-taught ones. ISCED-F codes (none for the AUC line) are my assignment. English requirements, deadlines and application fees not collected."
